*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.wasm binary
*.lnk binary
